{
  "name": "Build product catalog Slide and PDF output from an API with Cloud Office Print",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Product catalog slide on request\n\nA sales rep picks a category on a form and gets a fresh PowerPoint slides, a PDF handout and slide images saved in Google Drive.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Choose a category** is an n8n form.\n2. **Get products** reads that category from a products API.\n3. Cloud Office Print fills the PPTX template: a cover, one slide per product with its photo, and a closing slide.\n4. The deck is converted to a PDF handout.\n5. Every slide is also rendered as a JPEG for chat or the website.\n6. All three files are uploaded to Google Drive.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Install the `n8n-nodes-cloudofficeprint` community node.\n2. Add your Cloud Office Print credential to the three Cloud Office Print nodes.\n3. Set your company and sales contact in **Slide settings**.\n4. Connect Google Drive, see the note under the workflow.",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 420
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        464,
        -288
      ],
      "id": "de770819-16d8-484c-842d-3275d0ae3010",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Get the products\nSwap the API URL for your data(here we used dummy rest API ). **Prepare slides** decides what each product slide shows.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 980,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        896,
        -96
      ],
      "id": "95d9b8c3-876a-4de4-84a8-c847543cacfd",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Get the products"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Build the Slides, handout and images\nThe `{!products}` tag repeats the product slide once per product. `{%image}` places the product photo.\n\n**Download  template** gets the template from Google Drive. Pick your own copy there.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 1240,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        -96
      ],
      "id": "cfd07d70-1f44-4c68-b225-e12ae9d7eefe",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Build the deck, handout and images"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Google Drive setup\n1. In n8n, create a **Google Drive OAuth2 API** credential. On n8n Cloud, just sign in with Google.\n2. Self-hosted: in Google Cloud, enable the Google Drive API, create an OAuth client ID and add the **OAuth Redirect URL** shown in n8n. Paste the client ID and secret into the credential and sign in.\n3. Select the credential on **Upload to Google Drive** and pick a folder.",
        "height": 392,
        "width": 248,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2928,
        176
      ],
      "id": "3325c433-76d3-4737-b61d-2285ab2c0382",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Google Drive setup"
    },
